  "notes": "Horizontal \"XIAOMI\" wordmark (2021 identity), from Commons file \"Xiaomi New Font.svg\" (Illustrator export, original upload https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/13/Xiaomi_New_Font.svg; Commons cites https://www.mi.com/global). Letterforms match the wordmark in Xiaomi's own SVG at https://cdna.sec.miui.com/mi-trust-center/group-mi-logo-mobile.svg. Six paths (x, i, a, o, m, i), originally filled #7C7C7C; no transforms, no background, no ® mark. Counters of \"a\" and \"o\" are separate subpaths and knocked out via evenodd. Coordinates converted to absolute and rounded to 3 decimals; tight viewBox computed with svg-path-bbox. Simple Icons only has the orange \"mi\" squircle symbol (slug xiaomi), so the wordmark was preferred for the text bar. kind=\"camera\": Xiaomi phones (Leica co-engineered cameras) write Make=Xiaomi in EXIF."
